WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
He's really here again

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The guy on the hospital bed used to have a good relationship with him

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
His family wants him to drop out of school and work

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
The young man didn't want him to give up studying

5
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
I went out to work to earn tuition for him.

6
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Later there was an accident at the construction site

7
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,580
That's what people are like

8
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:14,700
Sister, I'll pay the fee

9
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:23,620
Okay, just scan this code

10
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:24,620
Okay, the account has arrived

11
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:28,980
Thank you sister

12
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:31,050
I still have to pay 600 for rent.

13
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:32,050
Two hundred left

14
00:00:32,050 --> 00:00:34,050
Still have to last half a month
